<title>FRANCE: Rexel 1996 net attrib rises.</title>
<headline>Rexel 1996 net attrib rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			 611   vs    520</p>
<p>    Gross dividend (francs)	     29.4   vs  21.75</p>
<p>    Pre-exceptional			1,208   vs  1,011</p>
<p>    Operating				1,236   vs  1,095</p>
<p>    Turnover				24,395   vs 22,084</p>
<p>NOTE - Rexel gave the results in a statement.</p>
</text>
